            <description>&lt;h2&gt;Production Desk 1.4.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Check for updates from the Production Desk menu.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Choose automatic update checks and optional automatic downloading and installation.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Update downloads are verified before installation.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Pending project changes are saved before restarting for an update.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update delivery requires the update host at updates.squidproductions.org to be activated. Local scheduling remains available offline.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
